and\\vec t\\in\\operatorname{TermStage}_\\Lambda(n)^r\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{TermStage}_\\Lambda(n),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;\\subseteq\\operatorname{Tree}_\\Lambda,\\\\\n\\Lambda\\subseteq\\Lambda&#39;&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_{\\Lambda&#39;}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{TermStage}_\\Lambda(0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{a():a\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\\cup C\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{TermStage}_\\Lambda(n+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{TermStage}_\\Lambda(n)\\cup\n\\bigcup_{r\\ge1}\\{f(\\vec t):f\\in F_r\\land\\vec t\\in\\operatorname{TermStage}_\\Lambda(n)^r\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{TermStage}_\\Lambda(n),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;\\subseteq\\operatorname{Tree}_\\Lambda,\\\\\n\\Lambda\\subseteq\\Lambda&#39;&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_{\\Lambda&#39;}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"f2f6e5380b315983","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8225a5a04158160a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-variable]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda=\\langle C,